  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you re-enter a world that you have cached on Quest, the background audio will not play.\nRepro steps:  Load into a world with background audio (for example, Summer Solitude).  Observe background audio.  Load another world with background audio (Le Froge Ponde).  Now go back to a new instance of Summer Solitude.  No audio.  Go back to Le Froge Ponde.  No audio.  Audio sources that are stopped and started again play normally, but play on start audio enabled at world start does not. \nThis also happens with audio sources disabled, but are enabled with a Start udon behavior.\n\nThis was with a Quest 2.",
